    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CLARISSA: No, of course you must come. I mean it. I always wanted you to come. And everyone involved in the actual ceremony.\nCLARISSA: I don't know. Around sixty. Well it will, it will mean so much. The whole occasion. And so the least I can do is have you all to dinner. Jus…\nSALLY: My God, what if nobody comes? I suppose we can live for a month off crustaceans.\nCLARISSA: Oh, I take that as a yes. Oh, that's great. I'm thrilled. Oh, good.",
      "NELLY: What happens is, she says she wants something then it turns out she doesn’t...\nLOTTIE: Well she never does, does she? Never wants anything.\nNELLY: Especially when she's asked for it. That's a sure sign.\nLOTTIE: I wish I'd been there.",
      "VIRGINIA: Do you think she'd like roses?\nANGELICA: Yes.\nVIRGINIA: Let's put roses 'round the grass.",
      "JULIA: I thought you might like a cup of tea.\nLAURA: That's very kind, dear. I feel I'm stealing your room.\nJULIA: We put the food away, so... if you're hungry in the night, just help yourself.\nLAURA: Well, I will. You have somewhere?"
    ]
  },
